<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Nov 8.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Nov 8.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on Thursday.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>				 Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		     Yield    Close</p>
<p> 1   Villa World	    10.58    1.04</p>
<p> 2   Prime Credit Tr	10.54    0.93</p>
<p> 3   Prop Income Inv	 9.68    1.05</p>
<p> 4   BT Prop Trust	   9.60    1.70</p>
<p> 5   Indu Property	   9.48    0.96</p>
<p> 6   Colonial Mutual	 9.12    1.14</p>
<p> 7   Aust Tour		 8.82    0.85</p>
<p> 8   Centro Prop	     8.78    2.22</p>
<p> 9   Armstrong Retail	8.57    0.77</p>
<p>10   Spotless Svc	    8.55    1.29</p>
<p>11   Gandel Retail Tr	8.48    0.92</p>
<p>12   Equitilink		8.33    0.60</p>
<p>13   MT Leyshon Gold	 8.33    3.00</p>
<p>14   McIntosh Sec	    8.18    1.10</p>
<p>15   Advance Pro CB	  8.17    1.42</p>
